msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/user-profile.md:16
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"To open the avatar menu, click on your avatar icon in the bottom left corner "
"in the sidebar. This icon either shows your initials or a profile picture."
