#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper addlock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf upgrade --exclude zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:65
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Perform Host Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:69
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Perform the host upgrade according to the documentation of your operating "
"system. Because this is an advanced task, we don't provide detailed steps "
"here. After upgrading your operating system, proceed with the next steps."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:70
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Reboot Host"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:75
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"In case you did not reboot your system after the upgrade, make sure to "
"reboot your system now. Afterwards, check if everything is running as "
"expected. In case Zammad starts automatically, stop it again before "
"proceeding with the next steps."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:76
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust Package Repository"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:78
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Remove Old Repository"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:81
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Remove the old repository configuration file or disable/delete the old "
"repository in your package manager."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"Ubuntu 22.04:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.sources\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Ubuntu 24.04:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/zypp/repos.d/zammad.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/yum.repos.d/zammad.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:118
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Remove Old Repository Key"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:122
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Remove the old repository key from your system. Depending on your operating "
"system and version, the location or method differs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:123
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/keyrings/pkgr-zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/pkgr-zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"List the keys of your system:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"rpm -q gpg-pubkey --qf '%{name}-%{version}-%{release} --> %{summary}\\n'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Delete the key(s) related to Zammad (and only those!), replace `<key-name>` "
"with the actual key ID:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm -e <key-name>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"List the keys of your system:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"rpm -q gpg-pubkey --qf '%{name}-%{version}-%{release} --> %{summary}\\n'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Delete the key(s) related to Zammad (and only those!), replace `<key-name>` "
"with the actual key ID:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm -e <key-name>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:167
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add New Repository"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:171
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"If the repository key is different for the old and new version your "
"distribution or your distribution expects it in a different location, add "
"the new one. Otherwise, you can add the new repository configuration "
"directly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:173
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<!--@include: /installation/package.md{172,296}-->\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:174
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:44
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Update Zammad"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:176
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If there is a new Zammad version available and you want to update to it, "
"check the\n"
"[release notes](https://zammad.com/en/product/releases) for any required "
"additional steps.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:182
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Re-enable updates for Zammad and update Zammad to the latest version "
"available for your operating system."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:183
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"Update package index:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Re-enable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark unhold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"Update package index:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Re-enable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark unhold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"Update package index:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper refresh\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Re-enable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper removelock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper update zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf upgrade zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

