#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:214
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Updating Portainer Based Installations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:218
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"In your Zammad stack, click on `Pull and redeploy`, activate **Re-pull image "
"and redeploy** and click on `Update`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:220
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"![Highlighted stack update in "
"Portainer](/screenshots/installation/portainer-stack-update.png)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:221
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Updating Docker Compose Based Installations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "git pull\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:231
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker compose pull\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:243
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Docker Compose\n"
"\n"
"Without specifying CPU cores:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rake "
"zammad:searchindex:rebuild\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"With specifying CPU cores to use (example 8):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rake "
"zammad:searchindex:rebuild[8]\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Portainer GUI\n"
"\n"
"Open the [console via Portainer's "
"GUI](installation/docker#how-to-run-commands-in-the-stack) with the "
"standard\n"
"entrypoint `/bin/bash` and run:\n"
"\n"
"Without specifying CPU cores to use:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"With specifying CPU cores to use (example 8):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild[8]\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

