#: src/en/reference/es-indexed-attributes.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"- This page lists Zammad's default object attributes which are indexed by "
"ES. There are some more ES indexes, mainly\n"
"  about objects in the admin interface of Zammad. They are out of scope of "
"this documentation.\n"
"- Attributes marked as <Badge type=\"info\" text=\"SLA\"/> are only set if "
"the ticket is affected by SLA calculation.\n"
"  Please note that some attributes may not be set if specific conditions are "
"not met.\n"
"- Also note that some attributes may be reset to `null` if no longer "
"applicable.\n"
"- All timestamps provided by Zammad are UTC by default. This also applies to "
"times provided by ES.\n"
