msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/graphql.md:37
#, markdown-text
msgid "[Postman](https://www.postman.com/downloads/)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/graphql.md:38 src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:31
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/graphql.md:42
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"If not already present, create a [token in the Zammad "
"profile](/en/documentation/use/user-profile#token-access) you want to use as "
"API user. Depending what you want to achieve via API, set the permissions "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/graphql.md:45
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Make sure to copy it before closing the dialog because you can't view it "
"again. In case it went wrong, simply create a new token."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/graphql.md:46
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
