#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:185
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Expand Parameter"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:190
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"If you want to have additional related information, you can use the `expand` "
"parameter. Using it resolves the IDs and outputs values/names in addition."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:192
#, markdown-text
msgid "`GET`-Request sent: `/api/v1/tickets/search?query=welcome&expand=true`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (details)
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:193
#, no-wrap
msgid "<<< @/fixtures/rest-api/intro/get-expand-search-res.json\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:197
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Full Parameter"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:202
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"You can even extend the response by using the `full` parameter. Be aware "
"that this response can be huge. It outputs all assets including related "
"attributes and a `total_count` of search results as well."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:204
#, markdown-text
msgid "`GET`-Request sent: `/api/v1/tickets/search?query=welcome&full=true`"
msgstr ""

