#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:124
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:212
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Adjust the just copied file with a text editor of your choice (e.g. vi or "
"nano)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:127
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Locate any `server_name` directive and adjust `example.com` to the domain of "
"your Zammad instance."
