#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:159
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Apache"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:161
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1 - Enable Module"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:165
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Zammad requires a module (`a2enmod`) which is not enabled by default. CentOS "
"users have to adjust a config file because this module is not available "
"there."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:166
#, no-wrap
msgid "a2enmod proxy proxy_html proxy_http proxy_wstunnel headers ssl\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:171
#, markdown-text
msgid "If you want to run Zammad under HTTP/2, you will also need:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:172
#, no-wrap
msgid "a2enmod h2 proxy_http2 mpm_event\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:181
#, markdown-text
msgid "Click to open details for CentOS config:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (details)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:182
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add/uncomment the appropriate `LoadModule` statements in your Apache "
"config\n"
"in `/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"LoadModule headers_module modules/mod_headers.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_module modules/mod_proxy.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_html_module modules/mod_proxy_html.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_http_module modules/mod_proxy_http.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_wstunnel_module modules/mod_proxy_wstunnel.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Restart your webserver after saving the configuration.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:198
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2 - Get a Current Config File"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:202
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"The package installation copied a `zammad.conf` file to your webserver "
"config directory. Check if it is present and do not rename this file!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:204
#, markdown-text
msgid "Adjust your Apache config directory according to your setup:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:205
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls /etc/apache2/sites-available\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:209
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3 - Adjust the Config File"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:215
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Locate any `ServerName` directive and adjust `example.com` to the domain of "
"your Zammad instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:218
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Now you'll need to adjust the path and file names for your SSL certificates "
"you obtained. Adjust the following directives to match your setup:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:222
#, markdown-text
msgid "`SSLCertificateFile` (your SSL certificate)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:222
#, markdown-text
msgid "`SSLCertificateKeyFile`(the certificate's private key)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:222
#, markdown-text
msgid "`SSLCertificateChainFile` (the public CA certificate)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:226
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"If you don't have a `dhparam.pem` file yet, you can easily adapt the example "
"below to generate this file. You can find the correct path in your webserver "
"config. Search for `SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:232
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4 - Adjust HTTPS Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:239
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5 - Enable the Site"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:243
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"This step mostly depends on your selected folders and should only affect "
"`sites-available` folders."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:244
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu, Debian, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"Make sure the following line is present in your Apache config\n"
"(`/etc/apache2/apache2.conf`):\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Enable it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2ensite zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"Make sure the following line is present in your Apache config\n"
"(`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`):\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Enable it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"ln -s /etc/httpd/sites-available/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/httpd/sites-enabled/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:278
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6 - Save & Reload"
msgstr ""

